# # /prometheus-kinetics/
#
# Canonical URLs of the records of Prometheus, a database of combustion
# kinetic models, species, reactions, thermochemistry and experiments.
#
# https://w3id.org/prometheus-kinetics/ redirects to https://pr.omethe.us/
# https://w3id.org/prometheus-kinetics/<kind>/<key> redirects to
# https://pr.omethe.us/id/<kind>/<key>, for example
# https://w3id.org/prometheus-kinetics/species/XLYOFNOQVPJJNP-UHFFFAOYSA-N-1 (water).
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Lekia Prosper
# GitHub username: LekiaAnonim
#
# Richard West
# GitHub username: rwest

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^$ https://pr.omethe.us/ [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^(.+)$ https://pr.omethe.us/id/$1 [R=302,L]
